apps/macos-pending-verifications.md (Kotlin/Native + Xcode signing verifications deferred to the
macos-latest CI matrix, ADR-012). It is not caused by this surface and is not fixable from the
allowed files (Resources/*.entitlements + project.yml are out of scope).

